@startuml
|Student|
start
:View available teams;

|JoinTeamPage|
:Search for specific teams;

:Submit request to join a selected team;

|JoinRequestService|
:Send join request with selected team details;

:Return request status;

if (Request successful?) then (yes)
    :Notify team leader of new join request;

    |TeamLeaderService|
    :Display join request for review;

    if (Team leader accepts request?) then (yes)
        :Update team membership;

        |NotificationService|
        :Notify Student of acceptance;
        
        :Send acceptance notification;

        :Return notification status;
    else (no)
        :Notify Student of rejection;

        :Send rejection notification;

        :Return notification status;
    endif

    |JoinRequestService|
    :Return request status;

    |JoinTeamPage|
    :Display request status;

    |Student|
    :View request status;
else (no)
    :Return error status;

    |JoinTeamPage|
    :Display error message;

    |Student|
    :View error message;
endif

stop
@enduml